  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "CNC編程與實務(一)",
    "sub_ename": "THE OPERATION AND PROGRAMMING OF CNC MACHINES (1)",
    "describe_ch": "課程採20位學員修習上限，分組進行CNC銑床或車床的實務操作學習。任課教師親自帶領實務技能的養成，包含開機、校刀、加工座標設定、軸向動作預演與實際切削，讓學員具有程式編寫與實際銑削或車削出成品的團隊能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The course has a maximum limit of 20 students, and they are divided into groups to learn the practical operation of CNC milling or lathe tools. The teacher lead the development of practical skills, including starting up, setup the cutter compensations, setup the machining coordinates, axial movement observations and actual cutting. The students will have the team ability to program, and mill or turn workpieces.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
